# 快速安全扫描套件
- description: "快速安全扫描 - 仅高危漏洞"
- queries: .
- include:
    kind:
      - problem
      - path-problem
    tags contain: security
    precision:
      - high
      - very-high
- exclude:
    query path:
      - "**/ExternalAPIsUsedWithUntrustedData.ql"
      - "**/Metrics/**"